  unitName: Sea Princess Eriana
  unitId: 30996
  unitNumber: 1681
  description: As the daughter of the king of all oceanic fauna, Eriana was also
    the princess and shrine maiden for all the fauna in the sea, the counterpart
    to the World Tree in Vriksha. This role is thought to have been that of a guardian
    of order from the seas, who held unconditional love for all living beings. Tales
    tell us that Eriana saved countless shipwrecked souls during the God Army's war
    to exterminate humanity. Even now, she is worshiped as a goddess of the sea.
    Eriana is also said to have loved a certain navy general, and to have born a
    child from the relationship.
  summonDesc: I am the princess and shrine maiden for all sea fauna. I will gladly
    aid you, if it serves to protect the seas.
  fusionDesc: He has his duties to attend to.<br>I must see to my own, as well. I
    must serve as the guardian of the seas...
